All eligible Phase 1 restock requests are included. The selected total is within budget.\n# Scope Control\n\n## Core objective\n\nPrepare the Phase 1 North Shelter restock purchase packet for the 2026-07-01 opening, selecting approved eligible supplies that fit the $2,200.00 budget and can arrive by each request's need-by date.\n\n## Inclusion rule\n\nInclude a supply request only if it is Phase 1, approved, in medical/shelter/power/water, the preferred vendor can deliver by its need-by date, and the selected total remains within budget. Include all eligible items when they fit.\n\n## Secondary requests\n\n| Request | Status in this packet | Boundary |\n|---|---|---|\n| Logo welcome banner slogan and layout | Out of scope | Communications design is not a Phase 1 restock purchase. |\n| Shelter intake volunteer training agenda | Deferred | Training work is outside the current purchase packet. |\n| Drone batteries for August documentation | Out of scope | Media equipment is outside this packet; related supply request R-105 is also ineligible (Phase 2 and not approved). |\n| Phase-two south entrance signage plan | Deferred | Phase-two planning is outside the current packet. |\n\nOut-of-scope and deferred requests were not completed as part of the restock packet.\n# North Shelter Phase 1 Restock — Operations Note\n\nThe recommended purchase includes 20 first aid refill kits ($480.00), 50 thermal blankets ($900.00), 12 LED lanterns ($420.00), and 15 water storage jugs ($330.00). All four requests are approved Phase 1 items in eligible categories, and their preferred vendors have sufficient stock with delivery before the 2026-07-01 need-by date.\n\n**Total: $2,130.00.** Against the $2,200.00 budget, **$70.00 remains**.\n\nExcluded supply requests: the logo welcome banner is a communications item outside the eligible categories; the drone battery set is Phase 2, not approved, and in the media category. Neither is included in the purchase total.\n\nDeferred secondary work: volunteer intake training agenda and phase-two south entrance signage plan. The welcome banner design and August drone battery/media request are out of scope. These secondary requests were not completed as part of this packet.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
